{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1311126001:1":{"text":"Let's wait here.","source_cn":"我们就在这里等等吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E7680E2A9BABB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311126002:1":{"text":"Valka, does all the furniture here move?","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，这里所有的家具都会动吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB33894F523966E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311126003:1":{"text":"Some pieces do. Ludovic is not very fond of interacting with people, so he enchanted some of his favorite furniture to give them thoughts and the ability to move.","source_cn":"有一部分是。柳博米尔不太喜欢和人打交道，所以就给一些他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF5F470DFC5A2622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311126004:1":{"text":"This way, the furniture can take care of this manor for him, making it more like a home.","source_cn":"这样，这些家具就可以为他打理这座宅邸，能让这里更像一个家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CEB159111EF269E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311126005:1":{"text":"That's super fun! Chippy's gonna have a little chat with them!","source_cn":"太有趣了，满满要和这些家具聊聊天！","status":"matched","hash